<div class="space-y-6">
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Acessos &amp; permissões</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Veja o que cada perfil de usuário pode fazer no sistema.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/5 p-4 text-sm text-amber-200">
    <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
      <i class="bi bi-info-circle mt-0.5"></i>
      <span>
        As permissões são aplicadas no servidor pelos middlewares
        <code class="rounded bg-zinc-900 px-1 text-amber-300">exigirLogin</code>,
        <code class="rounded bg-zinc-900 px-1 text-amber-300">exigirAdmin</code> e
        <code class="rounded bg-zinc-900 px-1 text-amber-300">exigirBarbeiro</code>.
        Para dar acesso total a alguém, mude o perfil do usuário em <a href="/admin/usuarios" class="underline">Usuários</a>.
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {{#each perfis}}
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-zinc-800 p-4">
          <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg {{classeIcone}}">
            <i class="bi {{icone}}"></i>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">{{nome}}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
              {{#if (eq chave 'admin')}}{{contagem.admin}}{{else if (eq chave 'barbeiro')}}{{contagem.barbeiro}}{{else}}{{contagem.cliente}}{{/if}}
              usuário(s) com este perfil
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 space-y-3 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">{{descricao}}</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600">Rotas liberadas</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-300">
            {{#each rotas}}
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <i class="bi bi-check2 mt-0.5 text-emerald-400"></i>
                <span>{{this}}</span>
              </li>
            {{/each}}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>

  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-800">
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-zinc-800 text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-zinc-900 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left">Área</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center">Administrador</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center">Barbeiro</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center">Cliente</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-300">
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Site público</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Agendar online</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Minhas reservas</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Painel do barbeiro</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Painel administrativo</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Financeiro e relatórios</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-emerald-400">✓</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-zinc-600">—</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
    Quem tem perfil <strong class="text-zinc-300">barbeiro</strong> e também é cliente pode usar a agenda online normalmente:
    as reservas aparecem em <a href="/minhas-reservas" class="text-amber-400 underline">Minhas reservas</a>.
  </p>
</div>
